### Description
This collector list all the functions in the php files bellow. Multiple cases:
- public functions
- private functions
- static functions
- and other function you might encounter in php codebases

### file:File1.php

class File1 {
    public function publicFn() {
    }

    private function privateFn() {
    }
}

### file:File2.php

class File2 {
    public const CONST_PUBLIC = 1;
    public static staticFunction() {}
}

### JSON output
[
    {
        "name": "publicFn",
        "file": "File1.php",
        "line": 3
    },
    {
        "name": "privateFn",
        "file": "File1.php",
        "line": 5
    },
    {
        "name": "staticFunction",
        "file": "File2.php",
        "line": 4
    }
]
